# Cast for its mana cost {3}{W} (Black Lotus for three white, a Plains for the fourth) in Bot1's first main phase, the sneak
# cost was not paid, so the three Ninja Turtle Spirit tokens enter untapped and not attacking (CR 111.1): nobody attacks
# and Bot2 loses no life.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
The Last Ronin's Technique
Plains x18

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Plains.Play
Bot1.Hand.The Last Ronin's Technique.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: White)
Bot1.Battlefield.Plains.Activate
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Ninja Turtle Spirit Token#1.Tapped = false
? Bot1.Battlefield.Ninja Turtle Spirit Token#2.Tapped = false
? Bot1.Battlefield.Ninja Turtle Spirit Token#3.Tapped = false
? Bot1.Battlefield.Ninja Turtle Spirit Token#1.Token = true
? Combat.Attackers.Count = 0

[Expect]
Bot2.Life = 20
Bot1.Graveyard = The Last Ronin's Technique; Black Lotus
Bot1.Battlefield.Count = 4
